# What a voice is made from, and everything derived from it.
#
# `clips/` holds recordings of whoever the voice is supposed to be, and
# `latents/` is what those recordings become. Neither is ours to publish, and
# both are large, so nothing that lands here is ever tracked.
#
# The directory is, though. A checkout arrives with somewhere to put clips,
# which is the point of keeping them here rather than behind a path somebody
# has to be told about.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!**/.gitkeep
